@page "/help"
@* This component provides help and support information for the MedRef application *@
<PageTitle>Help & Support | MedRef</PageTitle>

<div class="container mt-4">
    <h1 class="mb-4">How to Use MedRef</h1>

    <section class="mb-5">
        <h3>1. Searching for ICD-10 Codes</h3>
        <p>Looking for a specific medical code? Follow these steps:</p>
        <ol>
            <li>Navigate to the <NavLink href="icd10-search" class="text-primary">ICD-10 Search</NavLink> page using the
                side menu.</li>
                <li>Type the name of the disease or condition (e.g., "Anxiety" or "Migraine") into the search bar.</li>
                <li>Click <strong>Search</strong> to see relevant results from the official medical database.</li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-5">
            <h3>2. Managing Your Favorites ❤️</h3>
            <p>Keep your important codes organized in your personal collection:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Save to Favorites:</strong> When viewing a search result, click the <strong>Save</strong> button
                    to add it to your <NavLink href="saved-records" class="text-primary">Saved Records</NavLink> list.</li>
                    <li><strong>View Favorites:</strong> Go to the <NavLink href="saved-records" class="text-primary">Saved
                        Records</NavLink> page to see all the codes you have collected.</li>
                        <li><strong>Edit:</strong> Need to add a reminder? Click the <strong>Edit</strong> button on any saved
                            record to add custom notes.</li>
                            <li><strong>Delete:</strong> Remove an item from your favorites list by clicking the <strong>Delete</strong>
                                button.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </section>

                        <section>
                            <h3>Need Further Assistance?</h3>
                            <p>If you encounter any technical issues or need help with account access, please contact our support team at
                                <strong>support@medref-app.com</strong>.
                            </p>
                        </section>
                    </div>